Greedy is the hardest pattern to recognize.

Not because the code is complex — most greedy solutions are short.
The hard part is trusting that the local choice is always safe.

Unlike DP, Binary Search, or Sliding Window — greedy does NOT have
a fixed template or a fixed set of patterns.
Every problem has its own greedy insight that you need to find.

What I am sharing here are the MOST COMMON greedy patterns seen on LeetCode.
These cover the majority of greedy problems you will encounter,
but greedy is a way of thinking, not a formula to memorize.

Here is the complete guide.

